## Original Content
Avantika and Jack Martin are thanking viewers after the news that their 'Friends'-esque series — Kaling's first sole creator credit since 'The Mindy Project' — has not been renewed for a second season at Hulu.

## Summary
Hulu has canceled 'Not Suitable for Work,' the comedy series created by Mindy Kaling, after one season without renewal for a second season. Cast members Avantika and Jack Martin expressed gratitude to viewers following the cancellation news.

## Key Points
- 'Not Suitable for Work' will not be renewed for a second season at Hulu
- The show was described as a 'Friends'-esque series
- This was Mindy Kaling's first sole creator credit since 'The Mindy Project'
- Cast members Avantika and Jack Martin thanked viewers in response to the cancellation


